00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:13.373
That's what we're
working towards.

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.790
So just a quick rundown of
what we're going to go through,

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:17.860
just the lifecycle
overall of an incident,

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.770
kind of calibrate everyone.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.820
Process management is kind of an
interesting component to this.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.560
We're going to go for that
real quickly, high level.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.977
And then we're going to dive
a little deeper into the data

00:01:28.977 --> 00:01:30.970
management as I see it,
and the future of it,

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:34.300
what we can do there, what
